  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span>베<ruby>걀<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> 졩<ruby>침<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/FHYLcJxOes4?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line lyric-muted\">\n    (<ruby>爸爸<rt>밯ˆ밯</rt></ruby> <ruby>아<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby>)\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    (pâh-pah ā)\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line lyric-muted\">\n    (<ruby>心肝<rt>심ˉ괄ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>囝兒<rt>걀ˆ띠ˊ</rt></ruby>)\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    (sīm-koā̰-kiâ̰-rí)\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>想<rt>슐-</rt></ruby><ruby>著<rt>둏-</rt></ruby><ruby>勞碌<rt>로럭ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>運命<rt>운먀ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siṵ-tioh-lo-lôrk’e un-miā\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>半暝<rt>봘ˋ메ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>目滓<rt>빡새ˋ</rt></ruby><a href=\"#_ftn1\" id=\"_ftnref1\"><strong>¹</strong></a> <ruby>澹<rt>담-</rt></ruby><ruby>著<rt>둏-</rt></ruby><ruby>被單<rt>풰돨ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    poà̰-mé bak-sài tam-tioh-phue-toâ̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>想<rt>슐-</rt></ruby><ruby>著<rt>둏-</rt></ruby><ruby>細囝<rt>쇠ˋ걀ˋ</rt></r